int json_session_handle(client_session_t *session, server_config_t *config);
.EE
.SH DESCRIPTION
Main entry point for handling a v2 protocol client session.
Reads v2 frames in a loop using \f[CR]json_frame_read(3)\f[R] and
dispatches them to channel\-specific handlers based on the channel ID.
.PP
The session loop continues until a disconnect is requested, the client
closes the connection, or an error occurs.
